<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Play Lamar's Space Adventures, restored from the original Java game with its artwork and soundtrack intact."
    />
    <title>Lamar's Space Adventures — Tazik</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,500;1,9..144,500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/site.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="lamar-page">
      <header>
        <a class="home" href="/" aria-label="Back home"><span class="signature"></span></a>
        <div class="eyebrow">restored from Java · powered by WebAssembly</div>
        <h1>Lamar's Space Adventures</h1>
        <p>
          My Grade 10 side-scroller, back in orbit with the original drawings,
          difficulty rules, and 3:39 soundtrack intact.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="game-shell" aria-label="Lamar's Space Adventures game">
        <div class="game-toolbar">
          <div class="stats" aria-label="Game statistics">
            <span>mode <strong id="difficulty-value">—</strong></span>
            <span>health <strong id="health-value">—</strong></span>
            <span>boost <strong id="boost-value">—</strong></span>
            <span>kills <strong id="kills-value">—</strong></span>
          </div>
          <button id="audio-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="true">sound: on</button>
        </div>

        <div class="canvas-wrap">
          <canvas
            id="lamar-canvas"
            width="640"
            height="500"
            tabindex="0"
            aria-label="Lamar's Space Adventures. Use W and S or the arrow keys to move, Space to fire, and P to pause."
          >
            Your browser needs Canvas and WebAssembly to play Lamar's Space Adventures.
          </canvas>
        </div>

        <div id="touch-controls" class="touch-controls" hidden aria-label="Game controls">
          <button type="button" data-action="up" aria-label="Move up">↑</button>
          <button type="button" data-action="down" aria-label="Move down">↓</button>
          <button type="button" data-action="fire" class="fire">fire</button>
          <button type="button" data-action="pause" aria-label="Pause or resume">Ⅱ</button>
        </div>

        <p id="game-status" class="game-status" aria-live="polite">Loading the original assets…</p>
      </section>

      <section class="field-notes" aria-labelledby="controls-title">
        <div>
          <h2 id="controls-title">flight manual</h2>
          <p><kbd>W</kbd>/<kbd>S</kbd> or <kbd>↑</kbd>/<kbd>↓</kbd> move Lamar.</p>
          <p><kbd>Space</kbd> fires. <kbd>P</kbd> pauses. After a crash, <kbd>R</kbd> retries and <kbd>Q</kbd> quits.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>the restoration</h2>
          <p>
            Rust/WebAssembly now runs the game state and collisions. Canvas and Web Audio
            provide the browser window, controls, original images, and unmodified WAV soundtrack.
          </p>
          <p><a href="https://github.com/taziksh/lamar-game">view the 2015-ish Java original ↗</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script type="module" src="/lamar/game.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .lamar-page {
    width: min(100%, 900px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  header { max-width: 690px; }
  header h1 { margin: 0.35rem 0 0.75rem; }
  header p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .eyebrow {
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 600 0.72rem/1.3 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .game-shell {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 18%, transparent);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: #09090d;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 55px color-mix(in srgb, #000 18%, transparent);
  }

  .game-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem 0.55rem 1rem;
    color: #aaa;
    background: #15151b;
    font: 0.68rem/1.2 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem 1rem; }
  .stats strong { color: #f1f1f3; font-weight: 500; }
  .game-toolbar button,
  .touch-controls button {
    border: 1px solid #3a3a43;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #e9e9eb;
    background: #212129;
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .game-toolbar button { padding: 0.48rem 0.72rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .game-toolbar button:hover,
  .touch-controls button:hover { border-color: #ec8b25; }

  .canvas-wrap { aspect-ratio: 640 / 500; background: #05050a; }
  canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    outline: none;
    touch-action: manipulation;
  }
  canvas:focus-visible { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #ec8b25; }

  .touch-controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: #15151b;
  }
  .touch-controls[hidden] { display: none; }
  .touch-controls button {
    min-width: 3.2rem;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
    touch-action: none;
  }
  .touch-controls .fire { min-width: 5rem; color: #111; background: #ec8b25; border-color: #ec8b25; }

  .game-status {
    min-height: 2.2rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem 0.75rem;
    color: #aaa;
